OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GElizabeth Alker introduces an
OL,6,     Gafternoon of specially made
OL,7,     Grecordings including a live
OL,8,     Gconcert from Wigmore Hall from
OL,9,     GTrio Gaspard performing music by
OL,10,     GFranz Schubert.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Palestrina
OL,12,     GDonald Macleod invites you to
OL,13,     GRenaissance Rome, starting in a
OL,14,     Gsmall town outside of the Eternal
OL,15,     GCity, where our investigation
OL,16,     Ginto the origins of Giovanni da
OL,17,     GPalestrina begins...
OL,18,G1700FIn Tune
OL,19,     GCaroline Shaw and Andrew Yee
OL,20,     Gperform from their new album Or,
OL,21,     GThe Whale.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
