OL,3,CProgramme listings for MON 18 MAY
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music,
OL,7,     Gwith works by Takashi Yoshimatsu,
OL,8,     GMadeleine Dring and John Rutter.
OL,9,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,10,     GTchaikovsky juggles beauty and
OL,11,     Gsuffering, Benjamin Britten
OL,12,     Greflects powerfully on grief and
OL,13,     Gconflict, and Leonard Bernstein
OL,14,     Ggrapples with the modern world.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: Full Moon on Progress
OL,16,     FSt
OL,17,     GDr Rommi Smith examines a turning-
OL,18,     Gpoint moment in the life of five
OL,19,     GBlack female musicians, revealing
OL,20,     Glesser-known aspects of their
OL,21,     Glife and work, going behind
OL,22,     Gstereotypes.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
